sequenceDiagram
  participant Sender
  participant App as Lazee App
  participant SDK as Lazee SDK
  participant Gift as GiftVault
  participant Receiver
  participant Relay as Sponsor Relay
  participant Account as Receiver Lazee Account
  participant Indexer

  Sender->>App: Create USDC gift link
  App->>SDK: create gift intent
  SDK->>Gift: deposit asset and store claim hash
  Gift-->>Indexer: GiftCreated event
  App-->>Sender: show claim URL
  Receiver->>App: Open claim URL
  App->>SDK: create or load C-address
  SDK->>Relay: sponsored claim transaction
  Relay->>Account: receiver authorization
  Relay->>Gift: prove secret and claim
  Gift-->>Indexer: GiftClaimed event
  App-->>Receiver: show USDC balance and receipt
